      "review.quillbot.what.sets.quillbot.apart.is": "What sets QuillBot apart is its sophisticated paraphrasing engine with 8 different modes, each tailored for specific writing needs. Whether you need to maintain formality, increase fluency, shorten text, or expand content, QuillBot's AI understands context and nuance to produce natural-sounding rewrites. The platform has evolved into a comprehensive writing suite including grammar checking, summarization, citation generation, and plagiarism detection.",
