      "review.quillbot.academic.writing.paraphrase.sources.avoid": "Academic Writing: Paraphrase sources, avoid plagiarism, and generate citations for essays and research papers",
      "review.quillbot.affordable.premium.pricing": "Affordable premium pricing",
      "review.quillbot.all-in-one.writing.space.combining.paraphrasing": "All-in-one writing space combining paraphrasing, research, and citation tools. Streamline your entire writing workflow in one place.",
      "review.quillbot.all.8.modes.unlimited.synonyms": "All 8 modes, unlimited synonyms, plagiarism check, faster processing, tone insights",
      "review.quillbot.both.offer.excellent.rewriting.capabilities": "Both offer excellent rewriting capabilities. Wordtune provides more real-time sentence alternatives and better tone adjustments. QuillBot has more paraphrasing modes and includes additional tools like summarizer and citation generator. QuillBot is more affordable, while Wordtune offers more polished rewrites.",
      "review.quillbot.catch.grammar.spelling.and.punctuation": "Catch grammar, spelling, and punctuation errors in real-time. Get suggestions for improving sentence structure and word choice.",
      "review.quillbot.chrome.extension.for.easy.access": "Chrome extension for easy access",
      "review.quillbot.citation.generator.for.academic.work": "Citation generator for academic work",
      "review.quillbot.condense.long.articles.papers.or": "Condense long articles, papers, or documents into key points. Extract the most important information quickly and efficiently.",
      "review.quillbot.content.rewriting.repurpose.existing.content": "Content Rewriting: Repurpose existing content into fresh variations for different audiences",
      "review.quillbot.control.how.much.quillbot.changes": "Control how much QuillBot changes your text. Fine-tune the balance between original phrasing and paraphrased content.",
      "review.quillbot.create.accurate.citations.in.apa": "Create accurate citations in APA, MLA, Chicago, and other formats. Save time on bibliography creation for academic papers.",
      "review.quillbot.creative.writing.requiring.unique.voice": "Creative writing requiring unique voice",
      "review.quillbot.document.summarization.quickly.extract.key": "Document Summarization: Quickly extract key points from long articles or reports",
      "review.quillbot.email.refinement.polish.professional.emails": "Email Refinement: Polish professional emails and improve clarity and tone",
      "review.quillbot.excellent.paraphrasing.with.8.different": "Excellent paraphrasing with 8 different modes",
      "review.quillbot.explore.quillbots.interface": "Explore Quillbot's interface:",
      "review.quillbot.faq1.answer": "QuillBot uses advanced AI and machine learning to understand the context and meaning of your text. It then rewrites it using different words and sentence structures while preserving the original meaning. You can choose from 8 different modes (Standard, Fluency, Formal, Academic, Simple, Creative, Expand, Shorten) depending on your needs.",
      "review.quillbot.faq1.question": "How does QuillBot's paraphrasing work?",
      "review.quillbot.faq2.answer": "Paraphrased content is not plagiarism if done properly. You must still cite the original source even when using QuillBot to paraphrase. QuillBot helps you reword content in your own voice, but academic integrity requires citation of ideas and information from sources. Always run important work through QuillBot's plagiarism checker to ensure originality.",
      "review.quillbot.faq2.question": "Is paraphrased content considered plagiarism?",
      "review.quillbot.faq3.answer": "Free allows 125 words per paraphrase, Standard mode only, 2 synonym options, and basic features. Premium offers unlimited words per paraphrase, all 8 modes, unlimited synonyms, plagiarism checker (20 pages/month), faster processing, and advanced grammar suggestions. Premium is $9.95/month and worth it for students and professionals.",
      "review.quillbot.faq3.question": "What's the difference between Free and Premium?",
      "review.quillbot.faq4.answer": "QuillBot produces original text that differs from the source, so it won't be flagged as copied content by plagiarism detectors. However, AI detection tools may sometimes identify text as AI-generated. The key is to use QuillBot as a writing aid, not a replacement for your own work, and always review and edit the output to add your own insights.",
      "review.quillbot.faq4.question": "Can QuillBot detect if I use it?",
      "review.quillbot.faq5.answer": "QuillBot currently works primarily with English text. While it can process text in other languages, the quality of paraphrasing is significantly lower. For best results, use QuillBot with English content. The team is working on expanding language support in future updates.",
      "review.quillbot.faq5.question": "Does QuillBot work in other languages?",
      "review.quillbot.faq6.answer": "Yes, QuillBot can be used for commercial content creation, marketing copy, and professional writing. Premium subscribers have full commercial usage rights. However, always review and edit the output to ensure accuracy, add value, and maintain your brand voice. Don't publish QuillBot content verbatim without reviewing.",
      "review.quillbot.faq6.question": "Can I use QuillBot for commercial purposes?",
