      "review.quillbot.pros.cons": "Pros & Cons",
      "review.quillbot.quillbot.excels.at": "QuillBot Excels At:",
      "review.quillbot.quillbot.excels.at.paraphrasing.and": "QuillBot excels at paraphrasing and rewriting, while Grammarly focuses on grammar, tone, and clarity. Grammarly has better grammar checking and broader platform integration. QuillBot's free tier is more generous for paraphrasing. Many users benefit from using both tools together for comprehensive writing assistance.",
      "review.quillbot.quillbot.is.a.powerful.ai-driven": "QuillBot is a powerful AI-driven paraphrasing and writing enhancement tool used by over 50 million students, professionals, and writers worldwide. Best known for its industry-leading paraphrasing capabilities, QuillBot helps users rewrite, edit, and improve their writing with advanced AI technology that goes far beyond simple synonym replacement.",
      "review.quillbot.quillbot.is.the.best.paraphrasing": "QuillBot is the best paraphrasing tool available and an excellent value for students, professionals, and content creators. Its sophisticated AI produces natural-sounding rewrites that maintain meaning while improving clarity and style. The generous free tier allows unlimited paraphrasing (125 words at a time), making it accessible to everyone. Premium at $9.95/month is remarkably affordable and unlocks unlimited word counts, all 8 paraphrasing modes, and plagiarism checking - essential for academic and professional writing. While it's not as comprehensive as Grammarly for grammar checking, QuillBot's paraphrasing capabilities are unmatched. The summarizer and citation generator add significant value, making QuillBot a complete writing toolkit. For students working on essays, professionals refining documents, or content creators needing fresh variations, QuillBot Premium is one of the best investments you can make in your writing. The free version alone provides tremendous value, but Premium is worth every penny for serious writers.",
      "review.quillbot.quillbot.vs.grammarly": "QuillBot vs Grammarly",
      "review.quillbot.quillbot.vs.wordtune": "QuillBot vs Wordtune",
      "review.quillbot.research.papers.properly.cite.sources": "Research Papers: Properly cite sources and ensure original wording",
      "review.quillbot.rewrite.text.in.8.different": "Rewrite text in 8 different modes including Standard, Fluency, Formal, Creative, and more. Maintains meaning while improving clarity and style.",
      "review.quillbot.scan.your.text.against.billions": "Scan your text against billions of sources to ensure originality. Get detailed reports on potential matches and citations needed.",
      "review.quillbot.seo.content.create.unique.variations": "SEO Content: Create unique variations of content to avoid duplicate content penalties",
      "review.quillbot.some.modes.locked.behind.premium": "Some modes locked behind Premium",
      "review.quillbot.standard.mode.2.synonyms.grammar": "Standard mode, 2 synonyms, grammar check, summarizer, 1200 words/summary",
      "review.quillbot.summarizer.quality.varies.by.source": "Summarizer quality varies by source",
      "review.quillbot.summarizer.saves.reading.time": "Summarizer saves reading time",
